1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:02,469
Hye-won helped me when she
found out about my situation

2
00:00:02,669 --> 00:00:03,870
but it wasn't pleasant.

3
00:00:08,173 --> 00:00:10,110
And I was always
in need of money.

4
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:15,849
Boss?

5
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,550
What? What's the matter?

6
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:19,619
May I ask...

7
00:00:19,619 --> 00:00:21,354
for an advance payment?

8
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:23,490
I guess it was a long shot.

9
00:00:25,759 --> 00:00:27,027
Yeah, sure.

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,380
Do you want it in your
monthly wage account?

11
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:31,798
Are you not going to
ask me why?

12
00:00:32,131 --> 00:00:33,633
No, it's okay.

13
00:00:33,633 --> 00:00:35,101
You must have
your own reasons.

14
00:00:38,905 --> 00:00:41,141
I've never seen
anyone like him.

15
00:00:41,441 --> 00:00:42,442
Thank you.

16
00:00:45,211 --> 00:00:46,212
What is this?

17
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:47,847
Did you see it?

18
00:00:47,847 --> 00:00:48,847
What?

19
00:00:49,382 --> 00:00:50,383
I said, did you see it?

20
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:53,805
How can I see it when
you took it away like that?

21
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,159
Alright, then.
You can leave.

22
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:00,326
Why is he acting like that?
